  (text "Q5 (P-FET) connects the pack to the LEDs only while ARM is high. R14 holds it off; Q6 pulls its gate" (at 17.78 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 60e3336f-1b58-55e6-8752-1baa659f5bf0))
  (text "down through R15 (Vgs = -0.91 x pack). C7 (gate-drain) is a soft start, C8 (gate-source) keeps Q5 off" (at 17.78 123.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74843e03-707e-5075-a452-a6c91fd7226d))
  (text "when cells go in. R4 holds ARM low while the ESP32 boots. Pack sense: BATT / 2 (470k + 470k, 5 uA) on GPIO1." (at 17.78 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d4ffa2a3-0f46-58cd-a021-9dc3d2219456))
  (text "B. LED switch (Q2) and LED head connector (J5)" (at 195.58 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6e42e060-d9ed-562d-82de-d67418d9c4d2))
