  (text "J5 -> LED head J1 over the 10-way ribbon: odd pins VBAT (LED_PWR), even pins LED_RTN." (at 195.58 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3f9b7210-4ea9-5cf8-8cef-ca194cfe3295))
  (text "Q2 is logic-level (5.7 mOhm max at Vgs 2.5 V): GPIO17 drives it directly. R6 47R slows its edge so" (at 195.58 120.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8bcc4cd8-6596-5a3e-846c-afd4cdb1b344))
  (text "the ribbon can't ring the LEDs into reverse bias (sim/). R7 holds Q2 off while the ESP32 boots." (at 195.58 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 15d04ef1-b3f5-599e-b5c5-f60e5806a7ee))
  (text "C. J2 - Waveshare ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 2x8 header (16-way ribbon, pin n = pin n)" (at 17.78 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9aa796a2-ae33-5fd6-9ddf-818725e6dd87))
